[h1][b]Hey, everyone,[/b][/h1]

[h3][b]Lex here, the head of Doghowl studio.[/b][/h3]

Just wanted to say a huge "Thank you" to all of you for your support during these first days. We know they are crucial—we are working very hard to address your feedback, and we really appreciate all of the ideas, kind words, and constructive criticism. 

We are rolling out a big hotfix today; check out the full patch notes below. We are increasing the max stash size, improving merc movement, increasing stamina and sprint speeds, reducing hostile drones’ visibility range, nerfing AI mutants, and much more. Also, we’re issuing daily ban waves to battle cheaters. If you encounter any, don't hesitate to report them to us [url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/1456940/discussions/10/]on this subforum[/url].

[h3][b]🛠️ HOTFIX 2 🛠️[/b][/h3]

[b]Merc Changes[/b]
[list]
[*] Increased stash size provided by stash upgrades by 50% total;
[i][Developer’s note: any upgrades you purchased previously (through upgrades or supporter pack) are retroactive and will increase your stash size right away][/i]
[*] Doubled the stack size of all bullet types (e.g., 60 9mm ammo can now stack as 120);
[*] Reduced character’s inertia so movement feels a bit more predictable;
[*] Increased mercenary’s sprint speed by 10%;
[*] Increased mercenary’s stamina by an additional 15%;
[*] Reduced jump cost from 12.5 to 10 stamina;
[*] Reduced the landing sound volume;
[*] Reduced the stamina recovery cooldown from 3 seconds 1,5 seconds;
